<view class="page">
  <view class="mine-hero">
    <view class="mine-hero__title">我的</view>
    <view class="mine-hero__sub">绑定你自己的服务 Key，配置只加密保存在这台手机上。</view>
    <view class="mine-hero__stats">
      <view class="stat">
        <text class="stat__value">{{history.length}}</text>
        <text class="stat__label">历史行程</text>
      </view>
      <view class="stat">
        <text class="stat__value">{{cacheSizeText}}</text>
        <text class="stat__label">缓存占用</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <view class="section-title">大模型服务</view>
      <text class="link" bindtap="toggleShowKey">{{showKey ? '隐藏 Key' : '显示 Key'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="tiny">用于「攻略」页生成 AI 速览。Key 由你自己在模型平台申请，不消耗开发者额度。</view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field__label">API Key</text>
      <input class="field__input" value="{{llm.deepseek}}" password="{{!showKey}}" data-field="deepseek" bindinput="onLlmInput" placeholder="粘贴你申请的大模型 API Key" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field__label">模型名称</text>
      <input class="field__input" value="{{llm.model}}" data-field="model" bindinput="onLlmInput" placeholder="deepseek-chat" />
    </view>
    <view class="badge-row">
      <text class="badge {{llmReady ? 'badge--on' : ''}}">{{llmReady ? '已绑定' : '未绑定'}}</text>
      <text class="tiny">未绑定时攻略页无法生成速览</text>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="saveLlm">保存配置</view>
      <view wx:if="{{llmReady}}" class="btn-ghost" bindtap="clearLlm">解除绑定</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <view class="section-title">导航服务</view>
      <text class="link" bindtap="toggleShowKey">{{showKey ? '隐藏 Key' : '显示 Key'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="tiny">用于景点检索、路线规划与距离计算。Key 由你自己在地图开放平台申请。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{providerOptions}}" wx:key="key" class="option {{provider === item.key ? 'option--active' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="pickProvider">
      <view class="option__radio">{{provider === item.key ? '●' : '○'}}</view>
      <view class="option__body">
        <view class="option__label">{{item.label}}</view>
        <view class="option__desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <block wx:if="{{provider === 'amap'}}">
      <view class="field">
        <text class="field__label">高德 Web 服务 Key</text>
        <input class="field__input" value="{{keys.amap}}" password="{{!showKey}}" data-key="amap" bindinput="onKeyInput" placeholder="高德控制台创建「Web服务」类型的 Key" />
      </view>
    </block>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="field">
        <text class="field__label">百度地图 AK</text>
        <input class="field__input" value="{{keys.baidu}}" password="{{!showKey}}" data-key="baidu" bindinput="onKeyInput" placeholder="百度控制台创建「服务端」类型的 AK" />
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <text class="field__label">百度地图 SK（开启 SN 校验时填写）</text>
        <input class="field__input" value="{{keys.baiduSk}}" password="{{!showKey}}" data-key="baiduSk" bindinput="onKeyInput" placeholder="未开启 SN 校验可留空" />
      </view>
    </block>
    <view class="badge-row">
      <text class="badge {{navReady ? 'badge--on' : ''}}">{{navReady ? '已绑定' : '未绑定'}}</text>
      <text class="tiny">{{provider === 'amap' ? '高德 Web 服务 Key' : '百度服务端 AK / SK'}} 只在本机加密保存</text>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="saveNav">保存配置</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <view class="section-title">天气服务</view>
      <text class="link" bindtap="toggleShowKey">{{showKey ? '隐藏 Key' : '显示 Key'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="tiny">绑定和风天气 Key 后可获取 7 天预报；不绑定则使用地图商自带的短期天气。</view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field__label">和风天气 Key（可选）</text>
      <input class="field__input" value="{{keys.qweather}}" password="{{!showKey}}" data-key="qweather" bindinput="onKeyInput" placeholder="在 dev.qweather.com 创建" />
    </view>
    <view class="badge-row">
      <text class="badge {{weatherReady ? 'badge--on' : ''}}">{{weatherReady ? '已绑定' : '可选'}}</text>
      <text class="tiny">留空保存即清除</text>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="saveWeather">保存配置</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <view class="section-title">历史行程</view>
      <text wx:if="{{history.length}}" class="link" bindtap="clearHistory">清空</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:if="{{history.length}}">
      <view wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id" class="history" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openHistory">
        <view class="history__main">
          <view class="history__title">{{item.destName}}</view>
          <view class="tiny">{{item.dateText}}</view>
          <view class="tiny">{{item.scoreText}}<text wx:if="{{item.costText}}"> · {{item.costText}}</text></view>
        </view>
        <view class="history__right">
          <text class="tiny">{{item.timeText}}</text>
          <text class="history__del" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="removeHistory">删除</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>
    <view wx:else class="empty-block">
      <view class="empty-block__title">还没有历史行程</view>
      <view class="tiny">生成方案后会自动保存在这里，方便对比和回看。</view>
      <view class="btn-ghost empty-btn" bindtap="goPlan">去规划一次</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <view class="section-title">本地缓存</view>
      <text class="tiny">已用 {{cacheSizeText}} / 上限 {{storageLimitText}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="cache-row">
      <text>共 {{cacheCount}} 条缓存</text>
      <text class="tiny">景点缓存 7 天，天气 30 分钟，路线 10 分钟后自动更新</text>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="clearCache">清理缓存</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">帮助与关于</view>
    <view class="menu-row" bindtap="goGuideHelp">
      <text class="menu-row__label">使用帮助</text>
      <text class="menu-row__arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="menu-row" bindtap="testService">
      <text class="menu-row__label">{{checking ? '正在检查服务…' : '检查服务状态'}}</text>
      <text class="menu-row__arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view class="source-line">1. 小红书 / 抖音 / 知乎等平台没有面向小程序的内容接口，攻略模块只由 AI 生成通用参考速览，并给出对应平台的真实搜索链接；小程序内不抓取平台内容。</view>
    <view class="source-line">2. 天气、景点与路线均带获取时间，过期会提示复核；开放时间与预约政策请以景区官方公告为准。</view>
    <view class="source-line">3. 本工具输出为决策参考，不替代官方售票、预约与安全提示。</view>
    <view class="tiny version">行程规划师 v{{version}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
